NC Digital builds professional ecommerce websites for businesses across Wales — custom online stores designed to make it easy for customers to find your products and buy with confidence. View our [ecommerce development service](/services/ecommerce-development/) for full details on platforms (Shopify, WooCommerce, SureCart) and pricing.

## What's included in our ecommerce web design service

- Custom online store designed for your products and brand
- Mobile-first design — most shoppers buy on their phones
- Fast loading speeds — critical for ecommerce conversions
- Secure checkout and payment gateway integration
- Product management system — easy to add and update products yourself
- On-page SEO for product and category pages
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking setup

## Why choose NC Digital for your Welsh ecommerce site?

- **South Wales based** — local support, direct communication
- **No templates** — your store is built for your specific products and customers
- **Built to grow** — add more products, categories, and features as your business scales

## Frequently asked questions

**What platforms do you build on?**

We build on platforms that give you full control and are easy to manage yourself. [Get a free plan](/free-website-plan/) and we'll recommend the right option for your business.

**How long does an ecommerce site take?**

Typically 2–4 weeks depending on the number of products and complexity.

**Can I manage the products myself?**

Yes. We build every store so you can add, edit, and manage products without any technical knowledge.

